      <abstract xml:lang="deu">
        <p>Erwähnt Abreise eines Cousins von Nic. I B. und hofft, dass ein Antwortbrief, den er gesandt hat, sicher angekommen ist</p>
      </abstract>
      <abstract xml:lang="eng">
        <p>Stirling sends greetings to the recipient, taken to be Nicolaus I Bernoulli, through the latter's cousin, whose imminent departure he has learned of only at short notice. Having no important mathematical news to report, he expresses the wish that Bernoulli's investigations should be published. In a postscript he hopes that his earlier reply has arrived safely and proved satisfactory. The date, place of writing, and identity of the cousin remain unresolved.</p>
      </abstract>

